{
  "_doc": "Cross-language schema contract between Python (bristlenose/events.py) and Swift (desktop/Bristlenose/Bristlenose/PipelineSummary.swift). Both sides round-trip these scenarios in tests. If you change this file, both sides' tests must continue to pass. Established 7 May 2026 for branches pipeline-summary-events (Python) and pipeline-diagnostic-pill (Swift). Schema version 2: added duration_ms on StageOutcome. Schema version 3: added run_completed_partial_truncated scenario locking STAGE_FAILED_MAX=10 overflow marker shape. Schema version 4: realigned session_id values to ordinal format (s1, s2, ...) matching what bristlenose actually emits at runtime — earlier versions used illustrative descriptive ids that didn't reflect production shape. Schema version 5: added topics bucket to PipelineSummary (between transcripts and quotes) to carry s08 topic-segmentation StageOutcome. Schema-additive — Swift readers that don't yet decode the field still parse fine. Added run_failed_abandoned_at_topics scenario locking the topics-populated shape for the A4-stage-cache-honesty cohort. Schema version 6: added optional source_file on StageFailure (basename of the input file a failure is about — session_id cannot identify a file that failed before a session existed) and the cloud_fetch cause category (a placeholder that never materialised, which must never be reported as a damaged file). Scenario run_completed_partial_cloud_fetch locks both. Schema version 6 also adds run_completed_cached_stage, which locks duration_ms: null for a stage that was present but didn't run. Every prior scenario carried a real duration, so the Swift side's non-optional Int decoded fine in tests while failing on real cached runs — the fixture flattered the code. Schema version 7: added optional `reason` on Cause — the `UnusableReason` discriminator for `unusable_input`, which the desktop popover localises from. Additive: entries in every earlier scenario omit it and must keep decoding. Added run_completed_partial_refusals, the first scenario to cover a refusal at all — the ingest bucket and its Cause shape had shipped unpinned by this contract.",
